                <pb facs="0381" n="261" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg261"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Barrett to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-12-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Barrett reports that upon further investigation it is shown that the
                    conspiracy aimed to assassinate the President of Colombia in his residence last
                    night. Former minister for foreign affairs, Felipe <pb facs="0382" n="262"
                        xml:id="pg262"/> Angulo, is the chief of the conspirators. Confidence in the
                    government has been restored by the prompt action of the President in arresting
                    the conspirators and providing a speedy trial for them, and complete calm
                    prevails.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
